'Final Product':'最終成品',
'Readable at a glance, built to look the part.':'一眼看懂狀態，也撐得起電競質感。',
'A streaming controller and its companion software. Starting from how streamers actually use it mid-broadcast, I built a visual system that makes every state readable at a glance on a small screen, without giving up the bold esports look the product needed.':'一台直播控制器與搭配的電腦軟體。我從直播主在直播中實際操作的情境出發，設計出一套在小螢幕上也能一眼看懂狀態、同時保有電競視覺張力的設計系統。',
'Streamers glance at the controller. They don’t study it.':'直播主只會瞄一眼控制器，不會盯著看',
'NEXUS is AVerMedia’s streaming software, paired with the Live Streamer NEXUS controller. Streamers use its touchscreen and knobs to switch capture sources, mix audio and trigger hotkeys.':'NEXUS 是圓剛（AVerMedia）的直播軟體，搭配 Live Streamer NEXUS 控制器使用。直播主透過觸控螢幕與旋鈕切換畫面、混音和觸發快捷鍵。',
'Mid-stream, attention is on the game and the audience; the controller gets only a glance. So every button has to show what it does and whether it’s on, in that split second.':'直播時注意力在遊戲和觀眾身上，控制器只會被瞄一眼。所以每顆按鈕都要在那一瞬間說清楚：這是什麼功能、現在是開還是關。',
'Project at a Glance':'專案速覽',
'State readable at a glance':'一眼看懂開關狀態',
'Hotkeys pair each app’s brand color with motion: on is full color and animated, off dims to a dark tone.':'Hotkey 以各軟體的品牌色搭配動態：開啟時全彩並帶有動畫，關閉時轉為暗色。',
'One look across hardware and software':'軟硬體一致的視覺語言',
'The same components run on the controller’s touchscreen and in the desktop app, backed by an icon library with five interaction states.':'同一套元件同時用在控制器的觸控螢幕與電腦軟體，並以涵蓋五種互動狀態的 icon library 支撐。',
'A complete visual asset system':'完整的視覺資產',
'A boot animation with a millisecond-timed LED script, custom hotkey icons, and an app icon in 9 sizes from 16 to 1024 px.':'開機動畫與毫秒級的燈光腳本、客製化 Hotkey icon，以及 16 到 1024 px 共 9 種尺寸的 App icon。',
'A glance, not a gaze: streamers look down for a split second mid-stream, so state has to register instantly':'瞄一眼，而不是盯著看：直播主只會在直播空檔低頭一瞬間，狀態必須立刻被辨識',
'A small screen: on the controller’s touchscreen, subtle changes in an icon’s shape are easy to miss':'螢幕很小：在控制器的觸控螢幕上，icon 圖形的細微變化很容易被忽略',
'Same function, different channels: once NEXUS integrated platforms like OBS and Twitch, buttons with the same function but for different channels could appear on the same page, and had to be told apart at a glance':'相同功能、不同渠道：軟體整合 OBS、Twitch 等平台後，功能相同但屬於不同渠道的按鈕可能同時出現在同一頁，必須一眼就能區分',
'Two displays, one component: the same UI appears on the hardware touchscreen and in the desktop software':'兩種螢幕、同一元件：同一套 UI 同時出現在硬體觸控螢幕與電腦軟體上',
'Clarity without losing flair: this is a product for streamers and gamers, so it also has to look bold and polished':'清楚之外也要有質感：這是給直播主與玩家的產品，視覺必須夠搶眼、夠精緻',
'Design Decisions':'設計決策',
'Designing for a glance: from text labels to color and motion':'為「一眼」而設計：從文字標示到色彩與動態',
'The original icons marked state with tiny ON / OFF text, easy to miss on a small screen. After adding OBS and Twitch, same-function buttons for different channels also had to be told apart.\n\nMy first version used color families for channels and built the state into the icon. My manager and fellow designers felt the contrast should be stronger for quick mid-stream use.\n\nIn the final version, each hotkey uses its app’s brand color: full color and animated when on, dimmed when off. The state reads even from the corner of the eye.':'原本的 icon 用角落的 ON / OFF 小字標示狀態，在小螢幕上很難注意到。整合 OBS、Twitch 後，功能相同但渠道不同的按鈕也需要區分。\n\n第一版我用色系區分渠道，把狀態做進 icon。主管與設計師同事回饋，直播中切換很快，對比應該更強。\n\n最終版讓每個 Hotkey 採用所屬軟體的品牌色：開啟時全彩加動畫，關閉時轉暗。即使只用餘光也能看出狀態。',
'• Customizable, without breaking the system':'• 開放客製化，又不打破系統',
'In NEXUS’s online editor, streamers can set their own hotkey backgrounds and images. I drew icon sets in several styles so personalized layouts still look polished.':'NEXUS 的線上編輯器讓直播主自訂 Hotkey 底色與圖片。我繪製了多種風格的 icon，讓個人化配置依然精緻。',
'One visual language across hardware and software':'軟硬體共用的一套視覺語言',
'The desktop app uses a dark base to match the controller. I drew a clean line-icon library and specified five interaction states: Normal, Mouse over, Click, Disable and Focus.':'電腦軟體以深色為基底，與控制器一致。我繪製了一套線條簡潔的 icon library，並定義 Normal、Mouse over、Click、Disable、Focus 五種互動狀態。',
'Visual flair that carries the brand: boot animation and lighting':'撐起品牌質感：開機動畫與燈光特效',
'Clarity sets the rules, but the product should also excite at power-on. With a flashy esports concept, I animated the AVerMedia logo for the boot screen and designed LED effects that flash in sync.':'清楚是基本，但開機那一刻也要讓人興奮。我以華麗的電競風為概念，用圓剛 LOGO 製作開機動畫，並設計與動畫同步閃爍的燈光特效。',
'• Lighting scripts timed to the millisecond':'• 以毫秒為單位撰寫燈光腳本',
'The lighting changes fast, so I scripted each pattern precisely, millisecond by millisecond.':'燈光變化又快又複雜，我以毫秒為單位精準撰寫燈光腳本。',
'• App icon':'• App Icon',
'Based on the controller’s knobs and the software’s signature orange, I drew the app icon in 9 sizes, from 16 to 1024 px.':'以控制器旋鈕為概念、搭配軟體主色橘，繪製 16 到 1024 px 共 9 種尺寸的 App Icon。',
'NEXUS taught me to design hardware and software as one experience. The lights, the touchscreen and the desktop settings all answer one question: what does the streamer need to know right now?':'NEXUS 讓我學會把軟硬體當成同一段體驗來設計。控制器燈光、觸控按鈕和電腦軟體設定，都在回答同一個問題：直播主此刻需要知道什麼？',
'Shipped in 2021':'2021 年上市量產',
'Launched as a mass-produced product: AVerMedia Live Streamer NEXUS (model AX310).':'以圓剛 Live Streamer NEXUS（型號 AX310）上市量產。',

// ---- Reflections: what I would do differently ----
'If I did it again, I would test hotkeys in real streams, not only design reviews, to confirm the dimmed off state stays readable under real lighting.':'如果重做，我會在真實直播中測試 Hotkey，而不只靠設計審查，確認關閉時的暗色狀態在實際燈光下依然清楚。',

